1
00:00:53,840 --> 00:00:55,759
Ghost!

2
00:00:57,719 --> 00:00:58,520
Stop running around!

3
00:01:10,319 --> 00:01:16,040
I'm the female ghost here for your life.

4
00:01:19,840 --> 00:01:22,079
I'm the male ghost here.

5
00:01:27,959 --> 00:01:29,200
Boring.

6
00:01:29,799 --> 00:01:31,519
I know what you're looking for.

7
00:01:31,640 --> 00:01:32,840
Come with me, everyone.

8
00:01:35,079 --> 00:01:36,239
Don't wander off again next time.

9
00:01:36,239 --> 00:01:36,879
You hear me?

10
00:01:37,239 --> 00:01:37,959
Give me a hand! Give me a hand!

11
00:01:41,200 --> 00:01:41,719
Don't pull!

12
00:01:41,719 --> 00:01:43,040
Easy, easy.

13
00:01:45,200 --> 00:01:46,359
Easy now. Watch the steps.

14
00:01:46,359 --> 00:01:46,959
Take it easy.

15
00:01:47,120 --> 00:01:47,920
The steps! The steps!

16
00:01:47,920 --> 00:01:48,799
My leg! My leg!

17
00:01:50,519 --> 00:01:51,519
Slow down.

18
00:01:51,799 --> 00:01:52,719
Why are you such a pain?

19
00:01:52,719 --> 00:01:53,120
My leg!

20
00:01:56,079 --> 00:01:56,959
Smells so good.

21
00:01:56,959 --> 00:01:58,000
Is someone cooking?

22
00:01:58,239 --> 00:01:59,680
Who'd be cooking in a place like this?

23
00:01:59,680 --> 00:01:59,879
Wait.

24
00:01:59,879 --> 00:02:00,159
Let's go.

25
00:02:00,159 --> 00:02:01,799
Easy, easy, easy, easy.

26
00:02:08,919 --> 00:02:09,919
Holy crap.

27
00:02:09,919 --> 00:02:11,719
Young Master, what's going on here?

28
00:02:12,000 --> 00:02:12,759
No way.

29
00:02:12,759 --> 00:02:15,719
Why is there a banquet in this secret chamber?

30
00:02:15,919 --> 00:02:17,039
Are these people all...

31
00:02:18,080 --> 00:02:18,879
Miss.

32
00:02:19,560 --> 00:02:20,400
What's wrong with you?

33
00:02:24,080 --> 00:02:25,599
It's the Wan family's Yin-Yang Eyes.

34
00:02:26,360 --> 00:02:27,400
Then she must be Wan Chun'er.

35
00:02:27,879 --> 00:02:30,199
If the original Qi Family's Book of Talismans is truly hidden here,

36
00:02:30,800 --> 00:02:33,639
then I've finally gathered the Talisman, Curse, Seal, and Eye.

37
00:02:44,680 --> 00:02:45,599
Want to know?

38
00:02:45,599 --> 00:02:46,560
See for yourself.

39
00:02:57,520 --> 00:02:58,039
Food!

40
00:02:58,039 --> 00:02:58,439
Food!

41
00:02:58,439 --> 00:02:58,840
Food!

42
00:02:58,840 --> 00:02:59,240
Go, go, go.

43
00:02:59,240 --> 00:02:59,639
Food!

44
00:03:05,120 --> 00:03:06,360
Don't move.

45
00:03:06,360 --> 00:03:06,719
What?

46
00:03:06,719 --> 00:03:07,240
Stop eating!

47
00:03:11,400 --> 00:03:13,599
My tears haven't worn off, have they?

48
00:03:13,599 --> 00:03:14,919
They haven't.

49
00:03:14,919 --> 00:03:16,039
I can still see.

50
00:03:19,520 --> 00:03:20,919
What are they doing?

51
00:03:40,319 --> 00:03:41,800
A Feng Shui Killing Formation!

52
00:03:41,919 --> 00:03:42,599
They're trying to...

53
00:03:42,599 --> 00:03:44,120
...open the coffin to break the formation!

54
00:03:44,879 --> 00:03:45,439
Chun'er!

55
00:03:46,240 --> 00:03:47,000
Get ready!

56
00:03:51,039 --> 00:03:54,759
Ghosts occupy the center, suppressing heaven and earth.
Open the coffin to dispel the evil!

57
00:03:55,479 --> 00:03:56,360
Open the coffin!

58
00:04:41,680 --> 00:04:42,920
Cousin Ling Yu.

59
00:04:44,000 --> 00:04:44,959
What are you looking for?

60
00:04:46,120 --> 00:04:47,199
Is this it?

61
00:04:47,959 --> 00:04:49,360
What exactly do you want?

62
00:04:50,040 --> 00:04:52,680
I'm here to marry you, of course.

63
00:04:54,079 --> 00:04:56,439
Have you forgotten how you seduced me?

64
00:04:57,000 --> 00:04:58,120
Stop playing dumb.

65
00:04:58,959 --> 00:05:01,439
Qi Tiankun, you good-for-nothing!

66
00:05:01,639 --> 00:05:03,120
A toad wanting to eat swan meat!

67
00:05:04,519 --> 00:05:06,480
This good-for-nothing...

68
00:05:06,480 --> 00:05:09,199
...is about to eat swan meat.

69
00:05:10,160 --> 00:05:11,480
Take her away!

70
00:05:12,360 --> 00:05:13,160
Qi Tiankun!

71
00:05:14,079 --> 00:05:14,920
Qi Tiankun!

72
00:05:28,040 --> 00:05:28,839
Li Xiao.

73
00:05:31,199 --> 00:05:32,319
They hit you.

74
00:05:32,519 --> 00:05:33,720
They beat you up, didn't they?

75
00:05:34,920 --> 00:05:36,160
Does it hurt?

76
00:05:37,920 --> 00:05:38,399
It hurts.

77
00:05:39,240 --> 00:05:39,720
It hurts.

78
00:05:39,839 --> 00:05:40,560
Jiushuang.

79
00:05:40,560 --> 00:05:42,120
The Qi and Sheng families joined forces.

80
00:05:42,800 --> 00:05:44,519
I didn't want them to hurt you too.

81
00:05:44,959 --> 00:05:47,720
So I just took a few flesh wounds.

82
00:05:47,879 --> 00:05:48,680
It's nothing serious.

83
00:05:52,439 --> 00:05:53,360
What are you doing?

84
00:05:53,680 --> 00:05:54,839
Miss Mei.

85
00:05:55,160 --> 00:05:58,000
Our Qi family head invites you to the wedding.

86
00:05:58,120 --> 00:05:59,480
Come at me instead!

87
00:05:59,720 --> 00:06:00,920
Who the hell do you think you are?

88
00:06:01,920 --> 00:06:03,279
Let go of me!

89
00:06:03,279 --> 00:06:03,920
Jiushuang!

90
00:06:04,160 --> 00:06:05,040
Let her go!

91
00:06:05,040 --> 00:06:05,839
Jiushuang!

92
00:06:05,839 --> 00:06:07,279
I said, let her go!

93
00:06:07,279 --> 00:06:08,399
Jiushuang!

94
00:06:27,079 --> 00:06:28,160
Help me up.

95
00:06:30,240 --> 00:06:31,519
The original Qi Family's Book of Talismans.

96
00:06:31,519 --> 00:06:32,839
Tianyou, look.

97
00:06:36,079 --> 00:06:37,920
So the Wan family knew all along.

98
00:06:37,920 --> 00:06:39,839
The Qi family wouldn't just hand over the original.

99
00:06:39,839 --> 00:06:41,079
And specifically sent you to get it.

100
00:06:42,519 --> 00:06:44,959
Young Master, how did you know it's a Yin-Yang Feng Shui formation?

101
00:06:45,079 --> 00:06:46,000
Rats.

102
00:06:46,000 --> 00:06:48,160
You didn't notice when we were outside, did you?

103
00:06:48,199 --> 00:06:49,680
This place is a mine.

104
00:06:49,680 --> 00:06:51,120
The so-called Feng Shui Killing Formation

105
00:06:51,120 --> 00:06:52,759
is actually just the timing and terrain.

106
00:06:52,959 --> 00:06:55,160
The magnetic field here is abnormal,

107
00:06:55,199 --> 00:06:57,399
and the constant leak of Corpse Miasma

108
00:06:57,399 --> 00:06:59,720
combine to mess with people's minds,

109
00:06:59,720 --> 00:07:00,720
causing hallucinations.

110
00:07:00,800 --> 00:07:02,920
The so-called "eye" in Yin-Yang Talismans

111
00:07:02,920 --> 00:07:04,680
is actually just a medical prescription.

112
00:07:04,879 --> 00:07:06,240
Taking it over a long period of time

113
00:07:06,240 --> 00:07:08,160
will keep your mind clear

114
00:07:08,160 --> 00:07:10,040
and unaffected by external factors.

115
00:07:10,480 --> 00:07:11,279
However,

116
00:07:11,279 --> 00:07:13,639
it requires someone with a special bloodline and physique

117
00:07:13,639 --> 00:07:14,720
for it to be effective.

118
00:07:14,800 --> 00:07:17,199
Ordinary people would lose their minds.

119
00:07:18,639 --> 00:07:22,279
Are you the only one in the Wan family with Yin-Yang Eyes?

120
00:07:23,079 --> 00:07:24,519
Everyone, be careful.

121
00:07:24,519 --> 00:07:25,560
Watch your step.

122
00:07:25,560 --> 00:07:26,360
Someone's coming.

123
00:07:26,360 --> 00:07:27,040
Follow me.

124
00:07:29,360 --> 00:07:30,519
Cousin Ling Yu,

125
00:07:30,680 --> 00:07:32,959
how do you like this spot I chose for our wedding?

126
00:07:32,959 --> 00:07:34,519
Isn't it quite original?

127
00:07:35,000 --> 00:07:36,160
What is this place?

128
00:07:36,680 --> 00:07:38,720
This was originally the Qi family's territory.

129
00:07:39,079 --> 00:07:40,519
If my father hadn't been killed,

130
00:07:40,560 --> 00:07:42,040
I wouldn't have risked coming here.

131
00:07:42,800 --> 00:07:45,160
You guys, go clean up the secret room.

132
00:07:45,480 --> 00:07:46,439
After we get married,

133
00:07:46,439 --> 00:07:48,680
I'll take the Qi Family's Book of Talismans from the coffin.

134
00:07:53,480 --> 00:07:55,079
Once we leave this place,

135
00:07:55,240 --> 00:07:57,439
I'll be the head of both the Qi and Sheng families.

136
00:08:19,600 --> 00:08:20,600
Young Master.

137
00:08:20,600 --> 00:08:22,519
Qi Tiankun is such a psycho.

138
00:08:22,519 --> 00:08:24,000
He's getting married in here?

139
00:08:24,000 --> 00:08:25,079
I'm gonna kill him.

140
00:08:25,079 --> 00:08:26,079
Don't move.

141
00:08:26,079 --> 00:08:27,600
You can barely walk. Who are you gonna kill?

142
00:08:27,600 --> 00:08:28,480
Keep it down.

143
00:08:28,920 --> 00:08:31,600
Mr. Li, everything will be ready soon.

144
00:08:32,799 --> 00:08:34,919
We've only been in here a short while,

145
00:08:34,919 --> 00:08:36,120
and so much has happened outside.

146
00:08:36,120 --> 00:08:36,919
Yeah.

147
00:08:36,919 --> 00:08:39,279
Ling Yu must have been forced.

148
00:08:43,960 --> 00:08:44,799
Where is the girl?

149
00:08:45,840 --> 00:08:46,759
I'll go check.

150
00:08:48,320 --> 00:08:49,200
Mr. Li.

151
00:08:49,519 --> 00:08:51,879
I also locked Miss Mei in the right side chamber.

152
00:08:52,039 --> 00:08:53,600
She'll witness the wedding shortly.

153
00:08:53,600 --> 00:08:54,919
Well done.

154
00:08:55,399 --> 00:08:57,720
Only if she sees it with her own eyes,

155
00:08:57,720 --> 00:08:59,759
will the Mei family believe

156
00:09:00,120 --> 00:09:02,759
that you control both the Qi and Sheng families.

157
00:09:03,120 --> 00:09:04,279
Don't worry, Mr. Li.

158
00:09:04,440 --> 00:09:05,720
Once the wedding is complete,

159
00:09:05,720 --> 00:09:07,799
I'll immediately hand you the Qi Family's Book of Talismans.

160
00:09:22,519 --> 00:09:25,399
This guy wanted to marry into our Wan family before.

161
00:09:25,399 --> 00:09:27,200
Later, my brother kicked him out.

162
00:09:27,320 --> 00:09:30,279
Now he's off hooking up with Mei Jiushuang from the Mei family.

163
00:09:30,279 --> 00:09:32,799
He's trying to play all four families.

164
00:09:34,080 --> 00:09:36,840
This secret room in the Qi family's back mountain sure is lively.

165
00:09:36,840 --> 00:09:39,559
All four major families, Wan, Mei, Qi, and Sheng, are here.

166
00:09:39,559 --> 00:09:40,720
Along with Young Marshal Li.

167
00:09:41,120 --> 00:09:41,759
Let's go.

168
00:09:42,000 --> 00:09:43,200
Let's go find Mei Jiushuang.

169
00:09:50,759 --> 00:09:51,399
Sister Mei!

170
00:09:51,399 --> 00:09:52,559
Chun'er.

171
00:09:54,039 --> 00:09:55,200
Zhang Tianyou.

172
00:10:00,879 --> 00:10:01,879
Sister Mei.

173
00:10:01,879 --> 00:10:02,960
I have something to tell you.

174
00:10:03,159 --> 00:10:03,879
Go ahead.

175
00:10:03,879 --> 00:10:05,679
Li Xiao has been lying to you all along.

176
00:10:10,519 --> 00:10:11,759
Why are you here too?

177
00:10:13,600 --> 00:10:15,679
Special Corpse Miasma is starting to gather here again.

178
00:10:16,159 --> 00:10:16,960
Miss Mei.

179
00:10:17,600 --> 00:10:19,519
Just wait and enjoy the show.

180
00:10:34,279 --> 00:10:35,600
Ground rat.

181
00:10:36,240 --> 00:10:37,320
Move.

182
00:10:46,840 --> 00:10:47,919
Cousin.

183
00:10:48,360 --> 00:10:50,200
Qi Tiankun said you were dead.

184
00:10:59,600 --> 00:11:01,960
Have my father's remains been taken care of?

185
00:11:01,960 --> 00:11:02,840
On my wedding day,

186
00:11:02,840 --> 00:11:04,840
I must bow to my Parents.

187
00:11:04,840 --> 00:11:06,919
They've already been placed in the side chamber.

188
00:11:06,919 --> 00:11:08,720
The secret room is almost ready too.

189
00:11:08,960 --> 00:11:09,799
Master.

190
00:11:09,799 --> 00:11:12,679
Should I prepare a bridal chamber for you as well?

191
00:11:12,840 --> 00:11:16,360
You want me to consummate the marriage with the bride here?

192
00:11:16,360 --> 00:11:17,919
Forgive me.

193
00:11:18,879 --> 00:11:21,200
But it does sound quite thrilling.

194
00:11:21,200 --> 00:11:22,440
It's a good idea.

195
00:11:22,679 --> 00:11:23,679
Hurry up and go.

196
00:11:23,679 --> 00:11:24,360
Right away!

197
00:11:24,360 --> 00:11:25,360
I'll get it done immediately.
